{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼前髪割れた／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6745288/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佛教大学ライブ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンコール2曲も入れて全部で11曲！\n盛りだくさんでしたー\n楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6745288/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに盛り上がると\n思わなかったのでびっくりしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佛教大学のみなさん、\n乃木坂familyのみなさん、\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6745288/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6745288/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わったあと、\nみんなでラーメン食べたよー\nいや、戦ってきたよーラーメンと。\nすすれないよーくそー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チャーハンの取り皿を若月が\n持ってきてくれた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいか 普通の取り皿\nねね 普通の取り皿\n若月 普通の取り皿\nまりか ハム太郎のお皿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ん？ハム...⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーからも\nおこちゃま扱いされてまっくだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6745288/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6745288/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メガネかけたまま、眠ったり、\n顔洗ったりしたことあるでしょ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6745288/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6745288/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6745288/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンピューターいじるの\nすきですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6745288/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー...機械苦手です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6745288/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年お祭りどのくらい\n行きましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6745288/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イベントはいっぱい！\nあとは友達と一回行ったくらいかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6745288/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モンブランは好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6745288/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきだよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6745288/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルはゆったんと一緒"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6745288/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でへ\n明日もライブ楽しみです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではおやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}